# Testing

Do not add Vitest or Jest.

## Unit and integration (`bun:test`)

```ts
import { test, expect, mock } from "bun:test";
```

- Colocate as `*.test.ts` / `*.test.tsx` (including `*.integration.test.ts`)
- React: `@testing-library/react` (`getByRole`)
- Mocks: `mock()` from `bun:test`, not `vi.fn`
- Runner bootstrap stays at repo-root `test/` (`happydom.ts`, `setup.ts`), preloaded from `bunfig.toml`. Do not move it into a workspace package.
- External HTTP: shared handlers in `@repo/mocks`, already started in `test/setup.ts`
- Override per test with `server.use(...)` from `@repo/mocks/server`

## End-to-end (Playwright)

- Live in `e2e/<app>` (e.g. `e2e/web`), files named `*.spec.ts` so `bun test` ignores them
- Import `test` / `expect` from `../playwright.setup`, not `@playwright/test`
- Use `network.use(...)` to override MSW handlers for one test
- Async Server Components, auth, cookies, and real navigation belong here
